2026-08-25T23:09:48.7941893Z     Features
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7942089Z     --------
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7942281Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7942838Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7943473Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7943666Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7944091Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7944572Z       of test modules and functions
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7944821Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7945177Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7945697Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7946030Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7946378Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7946828Z       test suites out of the box
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7947069Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7947262Z     - Python 3.10+ or PyPy3
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7947492Z     
2026-08-25T23:09:48.7948058Z     - Rich plugin architecture, with over 1300+ `external plugins <https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/plugin_list.html>`_ and thriving community
